WEBVTT

00:02:31.555 --> 00:02:33.878
"Queerer than we can suppose."

00:02:34.807 --> 00:02:38.326
What is it that makes us
capable of supposing anything,

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:41.890
and does this tell us anything
about what we can suppose?

00:02:42.724 --> 00:02:48.082
Are there things about the universe
that will be forever beyond our grasp,

00:02:48.106 --> 00:02:51.473
but not beyond the grasp
of some superior intelligence?

00:02:51.497 --> 00:02:53.186
Are there things about the universe

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:57.457
that are, in principle,
ungraspable by any mind,

00:02:57.481 --> 00:02:59.000
however superior?